:: Check Event Requirements [system] {"position":"1575,400","size":"100,100"}
/* Switches repeatable events back on once their cooldown is over. In JS: a <<for>> over every event ran on every
   passage and cost more than the check itself */
<<run State.variables.events.forEach((ev) => {
	if (ev.cooldown > 0 && ev.once == false && ev.completedAtDay + ev.cooldown <= State.variables.date.dayCount) {
		ev.active = true;
	}
})>>
